    <string name="transport_sec_security">Security</string>
    <string name="transport_security_text">Every channel is end-to-end encrypted. Tox encrypts messages, calls and files with your contacts\' keys; Tor adds three more layers of encryption and hides your IP; Bluetooth uses its own secure session with pinned keys. Nothing is ever sent unencrypted in any mode.</string>
